{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2880", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2880/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2880/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2880/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2880", "id": 4455180570, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s8AAAABCYypGg", "number": 2880, "title": "operator<< for MavlinkPassthrough::Result missing MAVSDK_PUBLIC", "user": {"login": "dunnman", "id": 144444302, "node_id": "U_kgDOCJwLjg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144444302?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/dunnman", "html_url": "https://github.com/dunnman", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dunnman/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dunnman/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dunnman/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dunnman/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dunnman/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dunnman/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dunnman/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dunnman/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dunnman/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2026-05-15T15:49:29Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T04:36:14Z", "closed_at": "2026-05-20T04:36:14Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Title pretty much says it. Hit a linker error trying to stream a MavlinkPassthrough::Result to std::cout. Looks like the operator<< overload in the passthrough header is missing the MAVSDK_PUBLIC specifier that the equivalent MavlinkDirect one has, so the symbol doesn\u2019t get exported.\n\nIn mavlink_passthrough.hpp (line 94):\n`friend std::ostream& operator<<(std::ostream& str, MavlinkPassthrough::Result const& result);`\n\nIn mavlink_direct.hpp (line 126):\n`friend MAVSDK_PUBLIC std::ostream& operator<<(std::ostream& str, MavlinkDirect::Result const& result);`\n\nAdding MAVSDK_PUBLIC to the passthrough declaration should fix it I would think.\nBuilding latest main on Rocky 8 using g++ 8.5.0", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2880/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timelin